    "actClause": "AN ACT making appropriations for the support of government; to amend chapter 20 of the laws of 2010, relating to making appropriations for the support of government; and to amend chapter 46 of the laws of 2010, relating to making appropriations for the support of government",
    "basePrintNo": "S7605",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7605-2009",
    "coSponsors": {
